/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118359","id":4217425452,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc77YM4s","user":{"login":"ajreckof","id":66184050,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTg0MDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66184050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof","html_url":"https://github.com/ajreckof","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-09T20:56:42Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T20:56:42Z","body":"This is just a first look I haven't looked in depth on implmentation but the two things that comes to mind immediatly are :\r\n- Jump Scroll Mode should be the default as it is the closest to the previous workflow while still alowing for the new shortcut.\r\n- > Abstract classes can be merged into the first non-abstract class that inherits them via merge_abstract_class_tabs\r\n\r\nI'm not 100% sure of the usefullness of this behaviour but anyway it should not be on by default which I'm not sure wether it is the case or not because of your screenshots not having a canvas item tab\r\n\r\nOn the rest idea I'm mostly in favor of this but will take a closer look at the implementation sometime this week-end","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4217425452/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hoo