prefer this. I personally strongly agree. When you use inheritance, it can be quite a pain finding a random property in the current inspector.\r\n\r\nIf that's not convincing enough, maybe the jump scroll mode could be the default instead? It's pretty much the same as the current inspector, but with \"shortcut\" tabs at the top. \r\n\r\nEdit: ajreckof's comment confirms it: scroll jump it is. Sent at the same time so I couldn't see it when I typed this out. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4217426029/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4217531984","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118359#issuecomment-4217531984","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118359","id":4217531984,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc77Ym5Q","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-09T21:12:38Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T21:12:38Z","body":"> I'm not 100% sure of the usefullness of this behaviour but anyway it should not be on by default which I'm not sure wether it is the case or not because of your screenshots not having a canvas item tab\r\n\r\nThis behavior was pulled from the https://github.com/PiCode9560/Godot-Inspector-Tabs addon. Currently, it is true by default, but I'll change it to false. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4217531984/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4217605529","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118359#issuecomment-4217605529","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118359","id":4217605529,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc77Y42Z","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-09T21:22:33Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T21:23:47Z","body":"> Here's some snippets with the default modern theme\r\n\r\nThe scroll hints don't work with it on vertical mode. In that state, they should be toggled off, and the inspector use the theme variation with a panel.\r\n\r\nAlso, for the modern theme, the horizontal tabs should use the inner tab theme variation. Something should be done for the vertical ones too.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4217605529/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4217737467","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118359#issuecomment-4217737467","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118359","id":4217737467,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc77ZZD7","user":{"login":"pippenpaddleopsicopolis","id":12509097,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTA5MDk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12509097?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis","html_url":"https://github.com/pippenpaddleopsicopolis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-09T21:40:25Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T21:45:25Z","body":"I feel like the headers are redundant in the tabbed mode but this is just a nit.\r\n\r\n*Edit: they are still needed when the tabs are icons only.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4217737467/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4217763692","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118359#issuecomment-4217763692","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118359","id":4217763692,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc77Zfds","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-09T21:44:17Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T21:44:35Z","body":"They aren't redundant when the abstract tab merging is active, and you have an abstract class (niche).\r\nThe primary reason I left them is for \"parity\" (it would look slightly weird without a header in a specific setting configuration only) and accessibility (if you hide text in tabbar settings). \r\n\r\nI think the cost of removing them in terms of clarity is greater than the value derived from the deduplication. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4217763692/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4223655672","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118359#issuecomment-4223655672","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118359","id":4223655672,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc77v974","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-10T12:12:44Z","updated_at":"2026-04-10T12:43:40Z","body":"This PR will not be using #118358 in its final version for the vertical capabilities, but instead #116485. \r\nThis PR will keep using the two-commit version of #118358 until #116485 is merged, at which point it will be rebased directly onto master.\r\n\r\nAs such, the PR has been converted to a draft because it currently includes an extra commit (see below) that serves as a technical placeholder. This commit should **never** be merged into the engine as it is superseded by #116485. \r\n<img width=\"388\" height=\"88\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c8a1cf65-8bdb-4bbb-99e8-0961d59af1dc\" />\r\n\r\nIt also technically doesn't require the `hide_text`/`hide_icons` properties, as pointed out by @KoBeWi [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118358#issuecomment-4223779121). ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4223655672/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]